NON-OBVIOUS EDGE / SEESAW CONSEQUENCE
As capability markets mature, price and authority decouple. An agent
may spend pennies to acquire a VPS, a credentialed API call, a
persistent service or another agent =E2=80=94 each of which can expand its
reachable action space by orders of magnitude. Therefore Privately
should not model a money grant as '$X risk'. It should model purchases
as constructors of NEW CAPABILITIES and recompute authority/blast
radius after every acquisition. That is a stronger five-year primitive
than a simple agent wallet or spend cap.
